{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_156_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，王三月，壬午，杞伯姑容卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"二、夏，宋華弱來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"三、秋，葬杞桓公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"四、滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"五、莒人滅繒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"非滅也。中國日，卑國月，夷狄時。繒，中國也；而時，非滅也。家有既亡，國有既滅，滅而不自知，由別之而不別也。莒人滅繒，非滅也，非立異姓以蒞祭祀，滅亡之道也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"六、冬，叔孫豹如邾。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"七、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_156_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_156","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，齊侯滅萊。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}